 "name": "Maximum: Clock Hand",
 "type": "feat",
 "img": "modules/jjk5e/icons/techniques/golden-hour.svg",
 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Samsara Rewind</em></p>\n<p>As a bonus action, you can spend 5 CE to summon the <em>Clock Hand</em> to your hands for 10 minutes. The <em>Clock Hand</em> counts as a Simple Melee weapon that you are proficient with and has the finesse and reach property. It deals 1d10 piercing damage on a hit and has the Hour Hand and Minute Hand properties while you (not others) wield it.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Hour Hand.</strong> If used against a creature in stopped time, the Clock Hand deals an additional 3d8 necrotic damage on a hit.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Minute Hand.</strong> If used against a creature not in stopped time, on a hit the creature must make a Cursed Energy save or be frozen in time and suffer the penalties of stopped time until the end of their next turn. This can only force a save once per round.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
   "chat": ""
  },
